### Accounts
GET http://localhost:8089/api/accounts

### Successful transfer
POST http://localhost:8089/api/accounts/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{"fromId":1,"toId":2,"amount":100.00}

### Insufficient funds
POST http://localhost:8089/api/accounts/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{"fromId":1,"toId":2,"amount":999999.00}
